&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;The full 15-iteration field test — every A/B result, every gate decision, every per-task output — is open source:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
